# Line endings are pinned to LF in the working tree, on every platform.
#
# This repo commits generated artefacts, so the editor opens from a clone with
# no install. That only works if a rebuild produces byte-identical output
# everywhere. Without this, a Windows checkout hands the build CRLF sources,
# the regenerated files genuinely differ from the committed ones, and the next
# `git pull` refuses to run.
#
# The build normalises as well (scripts/write-if-changed.mjs), so a tree that
# was checked out before these attributes existed still behaves.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Byte-for-byte assets: never converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary

# Generated but committed. Marking them keeps diffs collapsed and keeps them
# out of the repository's language statistics.
web/app.js       linguist-generated=true
web/examples.ts  linguist-generated=true
